# ---- OS ----
.DS_Store
._*

# ---- Imagery & data policy ----
# Keep third-party Shroud photographs and large datasets OUT of the repo.
# Renders are outputs of the code, not source — regenerate them locally.
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
*.pdf
*.npy
*.obj
*.ply

# ---- Third-party CC BY 4.0 assets (tracked despite the *.obj rule above) ----
# The Moraes Shroud 3D model + our decimated derivatives are CC BY 4.0 and ARE
# committed, with attribution in third_party/moraes/NOTICE.md.
!third_party/moraes/**
